{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Yesterday I had to get up at 3 o’clock in the morning in order to depart precisely at 4 o’clock by the express post for here; the journey is over 16 miles, very frequently just up hill, down hill, but on a fine carriage road; at 8 o’clock we were here. — I find everywhere people whom I know, and who are otherwise obliging and friendly. After I had slept well, I set out on my way after 8 o’clock, under the guidance of a brother of the innkeeper, who showed me the remarkable Roman ruins and took me around the area, among other things to an estate of the brother-in-law of the General Prosecutor Eichhorn; we were on our feet until 11½ o’clock. — Trier has an excellent location on the Moselle, a beautiful valley of the greatest fertility, bounded by gentle vineyards. — In the afternoon I was in the churches."}}],"created":1795219213,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":199,"prompt_tokens":282,"total_tokens":481,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-iS6QTvbJtD8RrFcA0ByB4B1TdMBBiG2Z","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":282,"prompt_ms":408.655,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.4491312056737589,"prompt_per_second":690.0686398061936,"predicted_n":199,"predicted_ms":4642.184,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.44537373737374,"predicted_per_second":42.65233777894198}}